# principles
- never run django outside of the backend container. e.g. "docker compose exec backend {command}"
- never run npm or any node commands outside of the frontend container. e.g. "docker compose exec frontend {command}"
- The code needs to be portable to a remote server. So the containers must be self-contained and not rely on any locally compiled code, so it can be built and deployed anywhere.

